<title>USA: Pa. $44 mln Bryn Mawr deal repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Pa. $44 mln Bryn Mawr deal repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Pennsylvania Higher Educational Facilities Authority's $43.8 million deal, for Bryn Mawr College, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>PENNSYLVANIA HIGHER EDUCATIONAL</p>
<p>FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>(COMMONWEALTH OF PENNSYLVANIA)</p>
<p>RE: $43,800,000*</p>
<p>BRYN MAWR COLLEGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa / Aa3	 S&amp;P: AAA / AA-</p>
<p>		 CONFIRMED		CONFIRMED</p>
